    "title": "Beijing Reacts After Taiwan Leader Calls On US Support",
    "text": "Beijing is expressing anger over a recent exchange between Taiwan and the United States. Taiwanese President Lai Tsing-Te just urged U.S. President Donald Trump to maintain security support, pointing to growing military threats from China.\nThe next day, China's Taiwan Affairs Office fired back with a strong statement criticizing Lai's remarks.\nA Chinese official also repeated the regime's goal of bringing Taiwan under its control.",
